  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub054_old_F_01",
      "hash": "7e93fcb1ac6df72b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀哎呀～\\n多麼可愛的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub054_old_F_02",
      "hash": "7e93fdb1ac6df8de",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳想爬寶可夢塔嗎？\\n哎呀哎呀，真是個善良的孩子。\\c\\n……對了！\\n穿得整齊點去的話，\\c\\n說不定寶可夢們會更加高興呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub054_sys_01",
      "hash": "2f3d4f27f9152410",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從老奶奶那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]西服套裝[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub054_sys_02",
      "hash": "2f3d5227f9152929",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]把[VAR COLOR(0006)]西服套裝[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n放進了換裝箱！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub054_old_F_03",
      "hash": "7e93feb1ac6dfa91",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀哎呀～\\n那套衣服怎麼樣呀？\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳長得跟我的孫[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]子女很像，\\n忍不住就想讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳穿穿看呢……"
    }
  ],
